cmd.gamemode=Change the game mode (survival, creative, adventure, spectator).
cmd.god=Toggle invulnerability.
cmd.noclip=Toggle walking through solid blocks (also enables flying).
cmd.fly=Toggle flying: < and > move up and down, no falling.
cmd.heal=Restore health.
cmd.feed=Fill the hunger meter.
cmd.hydrate=Fill the thirst meter.
cmd.rest=Remove fatigue and restore stamina.
cmd.stamina=Show or set stamina in percent.
cmd.health=Show or set hit points.
cmd.hunger=Show or set hunger in percent.
cmd.thirst=Show or set thirst in percent.
cmd.fatigue=Show or set fatigue in percent.
cmd.temperature=Show or set body temperature in degrees C.
cmd.attribute=Show or set an attribute (strength, dexterity...).
cmd.skill=Show or set a skill level (mining, swimming...).
cmd.kill=Kill yourself (@s) or remove dropped items (@e).
cmd.respawn=Respawn at your spawn point.
cmd.spawnpoint=Set your spawn point to the current position.
cmd.crouch=Toggle crouching.
cmd.tp=Teleport to x y z (~ = relative) or to spawn.
cmd.pos=Show your position and chunk.
cmd.top=Teleport to the top block above you.
cmd.up=Move up N blocks and place glass under you.
cmd.spawn=Teleport to your spawn point.
cmd.stats=Show attributes and survival meters.
cmd.give=Give yourself an item.
cmd.clear=Remove items from your inventory.
cmd.inventory=List, sort or clear the inventory.
cmd.hotbar=Select a hotbar slot.
cmd.iteminfo=Show details of an item.
cmd.items=List item ids.
cmd.blocks=List block ids.
cmd.durability=Show or set durability of the held tool (percent).
cmd.repair=Fully repair the held tool.
cmd.time=Show, set or advance the game time.
cmd.timescale=Show or set the time scale multiplier.
cmd.daylength=Show or set real seconds per game day.
cmd.weather=Show, list, set or clear the weather.
cmd.season=Show or set the season.
cmd.seed=Show the world seed.
cmd.biome=Show the biome at your position.
cmd.biomes=List biome ids.
cmd.locate=Find the nearest biome of a type.
cmd.save=Save the world.
cmd.world=Show world information.
cmd.setblock=Place one block (undoable).
cmd.fill=Fill a box with a block (undoable).
cmd.replace=Replace one block type with another in a box.
cmd.clone=Copy a box of blocks to another place.
cmd.undo=Undo the last building command.
cmd.redo=Redo the last undone building command.
cmd.flatten=Flatten the terrain around you to your floor level.
cmd.raise=Raise the terrain around you.
cmd.lower=Lower the terrain around you.
cmd.smooth=Smooth the terrain around you.
cmd.drain=Remove water and lava around you.
cmd.flood=Fill the ground around you with water.
cmd.blockinfo=Show the block you are facing or at x y z.
cmd.help=List commands or show help for one command.
cmd.commands=Count commands by category.
cmd.version=Show version information.
cmd.credits=Show the credits.
cmd.cheats=Allow or forbid cheat commands in this world.
cmd.language=List languages or change the language.
cmd.mem=Show memory usage.
cmd.chunks=Show chunk cache statistics.
cmd.entities=List dropped item entities.
cmd.clearlog=Clear the message log.
cmd.quit=Save and return to the main menu.
cmd.debug=Toggle the debug overlay.

